          ]
        },
        "202060005": {
          "id": 202060005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "What's up?",
          "next": [
            202060008
          ]
        },
        "202060006": {
          "id": 202060006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Don't leave me hanging. What is it?",
          "next": [
            202060007
          ]
        },
        "202060007": {
          "id": 202060007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "What's wrong?",
          "next": [
            202060008
          ]
        },
        "202060008": {
          "id": 202060008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "Well... I've finally got some downtime, but I can't sit still, so I've been trying to keep myself busy",
          "next": [
            202060009
          ]
        },
        "202060009": {
          "id": 202060009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "Aglaea, Lady Tribbie... they all have their own fields they're dedicated to",
          "next": [
            202060010
          ]
        },
        "202060010": {
          "id": 202060010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "So on a whim, I wanted to try out some different jobs, learn some new abilities, and maybe discover some more hobbies!",
          "next": [
            202060011
          ]
        },
        "202060011": {
          "id": 202060011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "I've tried being a chef, a locksmith, a haunted house actor, an outfit model, a dromas tamer, an auctioneer...",
          "next": [
            202060012
          ]
        },
        "202060012": {
          "id": 202060012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "But none of them really felt like the right fit, you know?",
          "next": [
            202060013
          ]
        },
        "202060013": {
          "id": 202060013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "Got any other suggestions for me, partner?",
          "next": [
            202060014,
            202060016,
            202060018
          ]
        },
        "202060014": {
          "id": 202060014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Like the blazing sun destined to rise—",
          "next": [
            202060015
          ]
        },
        "202060015": {
          "id": 202060015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "You should cruise through the sky!",
          "next": [
            202060019
          ]
        },
        "202060016": {
          "id": 202060016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "How about a watercolor painter? It would help you improve your sense of color",
          "next": [
            202060017
          ]
        },
        "202060017": {
          "id": 202060017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Sounds like a good challenge, right?",
          "next": [
            202060019
          ]
        },
        "202060018": {
          "id": 202060018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "A dog trainer. I think you have a real talent for it",
          "next": [
            202060019
          ]
        },
        "202060019": {
          "id": 202060019,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "next": [
            202060020
          ]
        },
        "202060020": {
          "id": 202060020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "You've really given me an inspiration!",
          "next": [
            202060021
          ]
        },
        "202060021": {
          "id": 202060021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "I should think outside the box and take on more challenges that will take me to the skies and back!",
          "next": [
            202060022
          ]
        },
        "202060022": {
          "id": 202060022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "Like skydiving, for example. I'm not afraid of heights. I could probably go even higher",
          "next": [
            202060023
          ]
        },
        "202060023": {
          "id": 202060023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "Also... how about becoming a pro athlete?",
          "next": [
            202060024
          ]
        },
        "202060024": {
          "id": 202060024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "Based on my scores, I think I have a bit of a knack for it",
          "next": [
            202060025
          ]
        },
        "202060025": {
          "id": 202060025,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "next": [
            202060026
          ]
        },
        "202060026": {
          "id": 202060026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "That sounds amazing!",
          "next": [
            202060027
          ]
        },
        "202060027": {
          "id": 202060027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "I'm getting more and more excited just thinking about it!",
          "next": [
            202060028
          ]
        },
        "202060028": {
          "id": 202060028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "I'm going to go try it out right now!",
